{"v":4,"catch":"英雄一定會回歸。承載著整個銀河系的希望。","desc":"《VIPER PHASE 1》是SEIBU KAIHATSU於1995年發行的射擊遊戲。\n雖然遊戲系統很正統，但這款熱門遊戲的極高品質使其成為射擊遊戲粉絲的最愛。\n這個標題既包括早期運行的“舊版本”，也包括後來重新排列的“新版本”。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-12-12","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/531463e093bf18c2ace86b67ffd8d3b2f413895dcc3312ba5ab8baaa9bc71f69.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/270c32f9214e67247372be6ae0cdc1cf490483a94b96b4b0ea89ccfde5a23e71.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/07654b1f40b3c400a0967f2d2b23c2b19b438cc89b55dfe1336d3805805ea202.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9c8e0a08fe26db7bb4f2ba3e7c5b6e4460a3d2b48c88ad4baaf9e5d980265107.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0f02794794c5aaa46e74936a0fbff366ad81e851f1c1a69bf20fc1a26d9944bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/572eacf19341cb6de3141f9d990cba4cdc22518203ef0e169b9572a96c473b71.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f910200da000","dlc":[]}